# Run I (2026-11-06, user: "no noise pin", "removee i cloning loss", "use PER"):
# a PURE SAC fine-tune of c0 with prioritized experience replay -- no noise pin,
# no cloning of either kind (no in-loss TD3+BC term, and the separate fading
# cloning step at weight 0) -- with what run F kept: c0 step 15000, il_data +
# il_data_cover preloaded, LayerNorm critic, frozen encoder + GRU, 5000 critic
# warm-up updates and 1000 critic-only online updates.
#
# PER (torch_rl/episode_buffer.py): window starts drawn with probability p^0.6,
# importance weights (N P)^-beta / max with beta 0.4 -> 1 over the run (MAX_STEPS /
# UPDATE_EVERY updates), chunk priority 0.9 max + 0.1 mean |TD error| (R2D2), new
# rows (expert preload, HER legs, fresh driving) entering at the max priority.
. "$REPO/slurm/il_finetune_c0_sac_pin_dims.env"
unset ACTOR_LOG_STD ACTOR_BC_ALPHA
export IL_BC_WEIGHT0=0 PER_ALPHA=0.6 PER_BETA0=0.4
